# OLAV Provider Configuration Examples
# Copy the relevant section to .env to switch providers
# Last updated: 2026-02-09

# ============================================================================
# Provider 1: OpenAI (Official)
# ============================================================================
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=gpt-4o-mini
# LLM_TEMPERATURE=0.1


# ============================================================================
# Provider 2: OpenRouter (Recommended - Lowest Cost)
# ============================================================================
# Supports: Grok, Claude, Llama, Mistral, etc.
# Cost: $0.001-0.01 per 1K tokens (varies by model)
# Status: ✅ Tested & Working (v0.11.1+)
# 
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...  # Get from https://openrouter.ai/keys
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=meta-llama/llama-3.1-405b-instruct
# # Alternatives:
# # - x-ai/grok-4.1-fast (⚡ Very fast)
# # - claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022 (💪 Most capable)
# # - mistral-7b-instruct


# ============================================================================
# Provider 3: Groq (Fastest Open Models)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Speed (inference in <100ms)
# Cost: FREE tier available (with limits)
# Status: ✅ Tested & Compatible
# 
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=gsk_...  # Get from https://console.groq.com
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=mixtral-8x7b-32768
# # Alternatives:
# # - llama-3.1-70b-versatile (Larger, better quality)
# # - llama-3.1-8b-instant (Smaller, faster)


# ============================================================================
# Provider 4: Together AI (Good Balance)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Variety of models, competitive pricing
# Cost: $0.50-5 per 1M tokens
# Status: ✅ Compatible
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=...  # Get from https://www.together.ai
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-405B-Instruct-Turbo


# ============================================================================
# Provider 5: Anthropic Claude (Most Capable)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Quality, reasoning, safety
# Cost: $3-15 per 1M tokens
# Status: ✅ Compatible (native SDK support)
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-ant-...  # Get from https://console.anthropic.com
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=claude-opus-4-1-20250805
# # Alternatives:
# # - claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022 (Good balance)
# # - claude-3-5-haiku-20241022 (Fast & cheap)


# ============================================================================
# Provider 6: Azure OpenAI (Enterprise)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Enterprise deployments
# Status: ✅ Compatible
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=azure
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://your-instance.openai.azure.com/
# LLM_API_KEY=...
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=gpt-4o


# ============================================================================
# Provider 7: xAI Grok (Fast & Capable)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Latest frontier model
# Cost: Comparable to GPT-4
# Status: ✅ Tested via OpenRouter
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=xai
# # or
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=x-ai/grok-4.1-fast  # or x-ai/grok-beta


# ============================================================================
# Provider 8: Ollama (FREE - Local)
# ============================================================================
# Focus: Privacy, zero cost, no internet required
# Status: ✅ Tested & Working
# Setup: brew install ollama  (or apt-get on Linux)
#        ollama pull mistral
#        ollama serve  (in another terminal)
#
# LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# LLM_MODEL_NAME=mistral:latest
# # Alternatives:
# # - llama2:latest
# # - neural-chat:latest
# # - dolphin-mixtral:latest


# ============================================================================
# QUICK SWITCHING GUIDE
# ============================================================================
# To switch providers, edit .env and change these three lines:
#   1. LLM_PROVIDER
#   2. LLM_BASE_URL (if needed)
#   3. LLM_API_KEY
#   4. LLM_MODEL_NAME
#
# Then test:
#   export $(cat .env | grep LLM_)
#   uv run olav query "有多少个设备?"
#
# Should respond in <10 seconds with correct device count.

# ============================================================================
# COST COMPARISON (per 1M input tokens)
# ============================================================================
# OpenRouter (Llama 3.1 405B):     $1.23  ✅ Recommended balance
# Groq (Free tier):                 $0    ✅ Best for development
# Together AI (Llama 3.1 405B):     $0.80 ✅ Good alternative
# Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet:     $3.00 ⭐ Best quality
# OpenAI GPT-4o:                   $5.00 💰 Most expensive
# OpenAI GPT-4o mini:              $0.15 ✅ Cheap fallback
# Ollama (Local):                   $0    🔒 Best for privacy

# ============================================================================
# PERFORMANCE COMPARISON (avg response time)
# ============================================================================
# Groq (Mixtral):                 ~500ms ⚡ Fastest
# OpenRouter (Grok):             ~2-3s  ✅ Good balance
# OpenAI GPT-4o mini:            ~3-5s  ✅ Good balance
# Anthropic Claude:              ~4-6s  Good quality
# Together AI (Llama):           ~3-5s  ✅ Good balance
# Ollama (local Mistral):        ~2-5s  🔒 Only internet: latency

# ============================================================================
# RECOMMENDATION FOR DIFFERENT USE CASES
# ============================================================================
#
# 🏢 Production:          OpenRouter (cost + quality balance)
# 👨‍💻 Development:         Ollama local (free, no api key needed)
# ⚡ Speed matters:        Groq (fastest, free tier)
# 🧠 Quality matters:      Anthropic Claude (best reasoning)
# 💰 Budget tight:         OpenRouter free models or Groq
#
# ============================================================================
